 an unmapped path with no impl-plan. Then HemaSuite's assertion at `hematology-paper-writer/tests/test_h_mad_tdd_gate.py:116` should change. That edit belongs to HemaSuite `main`; say so in your closeout, or hand it back."},{"line_number":68,"content":"**Decided: the skills side was wrong; HemaSuite's pin is correct.** The premise \"it failed before this feature too\" did not hold: skills `main` and this feature's base `15681a53` both give `kind=test-missing`; only `feature/tdd-gate-fail-opens` gave `no-test-resolved`. Cause: `h-mad/hooks/h-mad-tdd-gate.sh` built `PRODUCTION_TARGET=$CANON_PREFIX/$NAME`, and `CANON_PREFIX` is the deepest EXISTING directory, so absent intermediate directories collapsed to `<root>/<name>`. Fixed test-first: RED `13f18121`, GREEN `e1dfed23` (`${CANON_TARGET%/*}/$NAME`, mutation row CG-PARENT). Acceptance: HemaSuite `tests/test_h_mad_tdd_gate.py` 9 passed. No HemaSuite change needed."}]},{"path":"/Users/kimhawk/.local/state/h-mad/grok-audit-surface/run-ab2c85dc2e25-20261024T132452Z/roots/gas-root-d6-s2v1-zmxo9u6q/docs/02-design/features/tdd-gate-fail-opens.design.md","matches":[{"line_number":214,"content":"both deny `no-test-resolved`. AC-3.6 (c): the same two fixtures under the `step3`-only state."},{"line_number":983,"content":"expects deny `no-test-resolved` and observes allow. The unconditional arm uses the canonical"},{"line_number":985,"content":"`out/lnk/x.py` expects deny `no-test-resolved` and observes allow, and the call still runs."},{"line_number":991,"content":"(AC-1.4: Codex expects deny `no-test-resolved`, observes outside). Each is its own run. The"},{"line_number":1042,"content":"| Outside-root `out/lnk/x.py` with `lnk -> tests` | stays deny `no-test-resolved`; positive `out/tests/x.py` allows; `out/src/x.py` denies | 1.11 |"},{"line_number":1044,"content":"| Dangling and loop, governed | M-12 fixed both deny `judge-error`, unfixed Claude allow and Codex `no-test-resolved`; M-13 and M-14 fixed both deny `judge-error`, unfixed both deny `no-test-resolved`; M-18 both allow, fixed and unfixed | 3.1–3.3, 3.5 |"},{"line_number":1046,"content":"| AC-3.6 (b) under `step5`: `src/` mode `0311` holding `src/prod.py` | fixed both deny `judge-error`; unfixed both deny `no-test-resolved`. `os.listdir` raises `PermissionError`; the test fails, never skips, when it does not | 3.6 |"},{"line_number":1051,"content":"| Header trim, exact marker, control byte, empty path, `--self-check` | trailing-space header is invisible to `PATCH_TARGET` today | 4.1–4.7 |"},{"line_number":1076,"content":"| Claude canonicalise call removed, module file left in place | M-9 expects deny `no-test-resolved` and observes allow | 1.5 |"},{"line_number":1077,"content":"| Claude canonical target used where the raw conjunct must stay | AC-1.11 `out/lnk/x.py` expects deny `no-test-resolved` and observes allow; the call still runs | 1.11 |"},{"line_number":1078,"content":"| Codex `canonical_directory` removed, import left in place | M-9 expects deny and observes allow; M-8 expects deny `no-test-resolved` and observes outside; each run alone | 1.5, 1.4 |"},{"line_number":1271,"content":"| `KINDS` members | `/opt/anaconda3/bin/python -c 'import sys;sys.path.insert(0,\"h-mad/scripts\");import h_mad_tdd_judge as j;print(len(j.KINDS), sorted(j.KINDS))'` | 11 distinct values: `judge-error`, `no-summary`, `no-test-resolved`, `no-tests-ran`, `pytest-error`, `pytest-missing`, `red-measured`, `test-missing`, `test-passing`, `timeout`, `venv-escapes-root` |"}]},{"path":"/Users/kimhawk/.local/state/h-mad/grok-audit-surface/run-ab2c85dc2e25-20261024T132452Z/roots/gas-root-d6-s2v1-zmxo9u6q/docs/01-plan/features/tdd-gate-fail-opens.impl-plan.md","matches":[{"line_number":410,"content":"- [ ] AC-1.4: `test_codex_case_root_m8_denies[forward]` and `[reverse]`. Deny `no-test-resolved`"},{"line_number":412,"content":"- [ ] AC-1.5: `test_codex_case_directory_m9_denies`. Deny `no-test-resolved`."},{"line_number":456,"content":"  with `cwd == \"\"` denies `no-test-resolved`, not `judge-error`."},{"line_number":553,"content":"- [ ] AC-1.1: `test_claude_symlinked_test_dir_denies[m4]` and `[m5]` deny `no-test-resolved`."},{"line_number":564,"content":"  `no-test-resolved`, `[tests]` allows and `[src]` denies. This is a regression pin. The existing"},{"line_number":715,"content":"- [ ] AC-4.2: `test_codex_indented_header_denies[m16]` denies `no-test-resolved`, and `[m17]` denies."},{"line_number":717,"content":"- [ ] AC-4.4: `test_codex_control_byte_header_is_judge_error[m20]` and `[u0001]` deny `no-test-resolved`."},{"line_number":757,"content":"| CX-CTRL | AC-4.4 control-byte refusal | control-byte check removed | `tests/test_h_mad_codex_tdd_gate_judge.py::test_codex_control_byte_header_is_judge_error` |"},{"line_number":987,"content":"| 14 | control-byte refusal (AC-4.4) | CX-CTRL | T4 |"}]}]},"locations":[]}
