{"type":"thought","data":"The landed test `test_codex_control_byte_header_is_judge_error`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" asserts `kind=judge-error`,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" not `no-test-resolved`."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe implementation"}
{"type":"thought","data":" plan contradicts itself."}
{"type":"thought","data":" It claims the test "}
{"type":"thought","data":"denies `no-test-resolved`,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" yet the test name, "}
{"type":"thought","data":"design, and sibling "}
{"type":"thought","data":"test all indicate `judge-error`."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe mutation CX-CTRL"}
{"type":"thought","data":" removes the control-byte"}
{"type":"thought","data":" check. Asserting `no-test-resolved`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" would make this mutation"}
{"type":"thought","data":" harmless, since a path"}
{"type":"thought","data":" with a control character"}
{"type":"thought","data":" would still fail to"}
{"type":"thought","data":" resolve as a production"}
{"type":"thought","data":" file. The `judge-error`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" assertion is what makes"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the check discriminating:"}
{"type":"thought","data":" without it, the path"}
{"type":"thought","data":" becomes a normal target"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and the assertion fails.\n\nThe unfixed tree captures"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the control byte in"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the path. The gate "}
{"type":"thought","data":"would likely deny no-test-resolved."}
{"type":"thought","data":" This would make the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" test pass at RED. That"}
{"type":"thought","data":" contradicts the plan's"}
{"type":"thought","data":" RED classification."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The unfixed behavior"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is hard to verify without"}
{"type":"thought","data":" git."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe design text explicitly"}
{"type":"thought","data":" mandates judge-error"}
{"type":"thought","data":" for bad headers when"}
{"type":"thought","data":" phase5_status is active"}
{"type":"thought","data":" or unknown. This hard"}
{"type":"thought","data":" contradiction with "}
{"type":"thought","data":"the plan's no-test-resolved"}
{"type":"thought","data":" assertion means an "}
{"type":"thought","data":"implementer would write"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the wrong kind. The"}
{"type":"thought","data":" RED classification "}
{"type":"thought","data":"only makes sense if "}
{"type":"thought","data":"the expected verdict"}
{"type":"thought","data":" differs from what the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" unfixed tree produces."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe test path `src/n.py\\x1f`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" contains U+001F, which"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the plan's trim rule"}
{"type":"thought","data":" explicitly preserves."}
{"type":"thought","data":" This means the control"}
{"type":"thought","data":" byte survives trimming"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and remains a bad header."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The unfixed behavior"}
{"type":"thought","data":" cannot be verified "}
{"type":"thought","data":"because the original"}
{"type":"thought","data":" code has been replaced."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe step3 case is "}
{"type":"thought","data":"consistent: an inactive"}
{"type":"thought","data":" bad header contributes"}
{"type":"thought","data":" no target, so allowing"}
{"type":"thought","data":" under step3 is correct."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The judge-error assertion"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is the only bug in "}
{"type":"thought","data":"AC-4.4; the test name"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and design text both"}
{"type":"thought","data":" require judge-error,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" while the acceptance"}
{"type":"thought","data":" criteria wrongly demand"}
{"type":"thought","data":" no-test-resolved. I"}
{"type":"thought","data":" am now systematically"}
{"type":"thought","data":" checking for additional"}
{"type":"thought","data":" internal contradictions"}
{"type":"thought","data":" that could mislead "}
{"type":"thought","data":"implementers."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe design was updated"}
{"type":"thought","data":" to v1.6 after implementation,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" but the plan was never"}
{"type":"thought","data":" revised. This audit"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is labeled cycle 1,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" yet the plan already"}
{"type":"thought","data":" recorded prior audit"}
{"type":"thought","data":" rounds. The orchestrator"}
{"type":"thought","data":" may be unaware of those"}
{"type":"thought","data":" rounds and re-auditing"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the current file."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nFlagging the plan "}
{"type":"thought","data":"for missing post-merge"}
{"type":"thought","data":" design updates could"}
{"type":"thought","data":" be wrong. The implementation"}
{"type":"thought","data":" plan is a frozen pre-implementation"}
{"type":"thought","data":" document that correctly"}
{"type":"thought","data":" targeted design v1.2."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The post-merge design"}
{"type":"thought","data":" amendments describe"}
{"type":"thought","data":" already-landed code."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The prompt treats the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" plan as the target "}
{"type":"thought","data":"document and the design"}
{"type":"thought","data":" as an audited reference."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe role line assigns"}
{"type":"thought","data":" cross-document consistency"}
{"type":"thought","data":" to the design audit,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" not the implementation"}
{"type":"thought","data":" plan audit. The output"}
{"type":"thought","data":" sentinel confirms this"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is specifically an "}
{"type":"thought","data":"impl-plan audit focused"}
{"type":"thought","data":" on writing-plans quality."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe plan cites design"}
{"type":"thought","data":" v1.2 as its contract,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" yet the design file's"}
{"type":"thought","data":" version history shows"}
{"type":"thought","data":" later versions that"}
{"type":"thought","data":" changed the contract."}
{"type":"thought","data":" This creates a cross-document"}
{"type":"thought","data":" inconsistency between"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the implementation "}
{"type":"thought","data":"plan and its source "}
{"type":"thought","data":"document. The effort"}
{"type":"thought","data":" contract requires sweeping"}
