{"type":"thought","data":" mode 0311 roots. The"}
{"type":"thought","data":" design canonicaliser"}
{"type":"thought","data":" calls `os.stat` on "}
{"type":"thought","data":"the spelled component."}
{"type":"thought","data":" Codex is being checked"}
{"type":"thought","data":" next."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nCodex v1.6 closes "}
{"type":"thought","data":"issue D-2: the Codex"}
{"type":"thought","data":" gate must refuse `judge-error`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" when the project root"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is not traversable,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" before any state walk,"}
