{"type":"thought","data":" root."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe plan's mode 0311"}
{"type":"thought","data":" root test does not "}
{"type":"thought","data":"contradict Codex v1.6"}
{"type":"thought","data":" D-2. Mode 0311 is traversable,"}
