{"type":"thought","data":" the mode 000 refuse."}
{"type":"thought","data":" An implementer following"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the plan would omit"}
{"type":"thought","data":" that check entirely."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe missing mode 000"}
{"type":"thought","data":" refuse is a must-fix"}
{"type":"thought","data":" because the plan locks"}
{"type":"thought","data":" to design v1.2, yet"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the current design "}
