{"type":"thought","data":" departures. Dropping"}
{"type":"thought","data":" it would leave the "}
{"type":"thought","data":"fail-open that the design"}
{"type":"thought","data":" explicitly closes.\n\n"}
{"type":"thought","data":"The `_on_disk_component`"}
