{"type":"thought","data":"Reading the unreadable"}
{"type":"thought","data":" directory test to verify"}
{"type":"thought","data":" its exact assertion."}
{"type":"thought","data":" Checking T3 bash order"}
{"type":"thought","data":" in the plan against"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the design for the "}
{"type":"thought","data":"unenterable block."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nEnough context gathered"}
{"type":"thought","data":" for component finding."}
{"type":"thought","data":" T2 spelling matches"}
{"type":"thought","data":" on-disk design. Root"}
{"type":"thought","data":" arm 2 test cannot distinguish"}
{"type":"thought","data":" spelled root from on-disk"}
{"type":"thought","data":" spelling when they "}
{"type":"thought","data":"match."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe plan omits the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" discriminating test"}
{"type":"thought","data":" `test_unresolvable_component_is_reported_in_on_disk_spelling`."}
{"type":"thought","data":" It also contradicts"}
{"type":"thought","data":" design D-2: the plan"}
{"type":"thought","data":" allows mode 000 to "}
{"type":"thought","data":"proceed, but the design"}
{"type":"thought","data":" requires refusal before"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the status walk."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe design document"}
{"type":"thought","data":" itself contradicts "}
{"type":"thought","data":"itself. It claims the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" gap is closed in v1.6,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" then immediately states"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the parity is not met"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and this design does"}
{"type":"thought","data":" not close it. The measured"}
{"type":"thought","data":" bullets describe the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" allow behavior, and"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the final line leaves"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the Codex gate refusal"}
{"type":"thought","data":" to the operator."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe version history"}
{"type":"thought","data":" explicitly records "}
{"type":"thought","data":"D-2 as closed in v1.6."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The apparent contradiction"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is resolved by the "}
{"type":"thought","data":"design's own structure:"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the \"Closed in v1.6\""}
{"type":"thought","data":" note was inserted before"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the older paragraph,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" which ends with \"The"}
{"type":"thought","data":" v1.5 text follows as"}
{"type":"thought","data":" history.\" The older"}
{"type":"thought","data":" text remains intact,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" so the design contains"}
{"type":"thought","data":" both the closure claim"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and the older conflicting"}
{"type":"thought","data":" wording."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe plan must be updated"}
{"type":"thought","data":" to implement D-2 and"}
{"type":"thought","data":" refuse mode 000 before"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the status walk. It"}
{"type":"thought","data":" also needs the Claude"}
{"type":"thought","data":" unenterable block in"}
{"type":"thought","data":" T3 bash order, which"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is currently missing."}
{"type":"thought","data":" N-1 is version-history"}
{"type":"thought","data":" only; the design body"}
{"type":"thought","data":" does not spell the "}
{"type":"thought","data":"algorithm, though landed"}
{"type":"thought","data":" tests exist."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nN-1 should be a should-fix,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" not a must-fix. The"}
{"type":"thought","data":" design body does not"}
{"type":"thought","data":" specify the `.` and"}
{"type":"thought","data":" `..` component rules;"}
{"type":"thought","data":" only the version history"}
{"type":"thought","data":" does. The plan's T1"}
{"type":"thought","data":" description of the "}
{"type":"thought","data":"canonicalise walk also"}
{"type":"thought","data":" omits them. An implementer"}
{"type":"thought","data":" might otherwise keep"}
{"type":"thought","data":" `.` and fail open."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nN-1 is a should-fix"}
{"type":"thought","data":" because the plan contains"}
{"type":"thought","data":" no task, pin, or mutation"}
{"type":"thought","data":" for the v1.6 fail-open"}
{"type":"thought","data":" decision.\n\nThe landed"}
{"type":"thought","data":" test comment around"}
{"type":"thought","data":" lines 165-190 will "}
{"type":"thought","data":"be quoted to confirm"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the expected component"}
{"type":"thought","data":" spelling.\n\nT3 correctly"}
{"type":"thought","data":" flags the hook as RED:"}
{"type":"thought","data":" it contains two `pwd"}
{"type":"thought","data":" -P` lines, but the "}
{"type":"thought","data":"test expects exactly"}
{"type":"thought","data":" one and carries M:H8."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\n`test_claude_gate_is_bash_3_2_clean`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is a guard."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe dynamic half correctly"}
{"type":"thought","data":" asserts deny rather"}
{"type":"thought","data":" than judge-error for"}
{"type":"thought","data":" an absent leaf. A contradiction"}
{"type":"thought","data":" exists between the "}
{"type":"thought","data":"empty header and CX-CTRL"}
{"type":"thought","data":" entries. T4 AC-4.4 "}
{"type":"thought","data":"claims no-test-resolved"}
{"type":"thought","data":" while the test is RED;"}
{"type":"thought","data":" if unfixed already "}
{"type":"thought","data":"produces no-test-resolved,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the RED flag is invalid."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The PATCH_TARGET regex"}
{"type":"thought","data":" captures control bytes"}
{"type":"thought","data":" in file paths such "}
{"type":"thought","data":"as `src/n.py\\x1f`."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe header is recognized,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" but the path points"}
{"type":"thought","data":" to a non-existent production"}
{"type":"thought","data":" Python file. The gate"}
{"type":"thought","data":" would deny no-test-resolved,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" which matches the plan"}
{"type":"thought","data":" assertion and passes"}
{"type":"thought","data":" at RED. This creates"}
{"type":"thought","data":" a double contradiction:"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the test is wrongly"}
{"type":"thought","data":" classified as judge-error"}
{"type":"thought","data":" rather than no-test-resolved,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and the RED flag itself"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is invalid if the assertion"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is no-test-resolved."}
{"type":"thought","data":" AC-5.1 and component"}
{"type":"thought","data":" spelling are solid."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe Codex D-2 and "}
{"type":"thought","data":"Claude unenterable issues"}
{"type":"thought","data":" will be reported as"}
{"type":"thought","data":" separate findings because"}
{"type":"thought","data":" they modify different"}
{"type":"thought","data":" gates. A new question"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is raised about whether"}
{"type":"thought","data":" mode 0311 directories"}
{"type":"thought","data":" pass the X_OK check"}
{"type":"thought","data":" while still failing"}
{"type":"thought","data":" canonical_directory"}
{"type":"thought","data":" because they cannot"}
{"type":"thought","data":" be read or opened."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nMode 0311 fails canonical_directory"}
{"type":"thought","data":" because open for read"}
{"type":"thought","data":" requires read permission,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" which the --x bit lacks."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The plan's rglob scan"}
{"type":"thought","data":" then yields unknown"}
{"type":"thought","data":" or active, and the "}
{"type":"thought","data":"design allows this step."}
{"type":"thought","data":" Mode 000 is fully denied:"}
{"type":"thought","data":" canonical_directory"}
{"type":"thought","data":" fails on the non-readable"}
{"type":"thought","data":" directory, rglob returns"}
{"type":"thought","data":" nothing, and the plan"}
{"type":"thought","data":" allows inactive status."}
{"type":"thought","data":" This confirms the plan's"}
{"type":"thought","data":" algorithm produces "}
{"type":"thought","data":"the allow behavior for"}
{"type":"thought","data":" both modes."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe plan omits a mode"}
{"type":"thought","data":" 000 root test, so an"}
{"type":"thought","data":" implementer following"}
{"type":"thought","data":" T2 would allow that"}
{"type":"thought","data":" case. The Claude ungoverned"}
{"type":"thought","data":" check for mode 0311"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is also missing; the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" design allows enterable"}
{"type":"thought","data":" roots at that mode,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" but the plan does not"}
{"type":"thought","data":" mention it."}
